id: pm-t2dqzijokl31
title: "GH-1547: correct linked-resource positional misuse in refusal recovery"
description: GitHub #1547 reports natural positional files/docs/test usage that currently repeats the failed invocation without a legal retry. Provide exact corrected argument-vector recovery while preserving explicit collection mutation semantics.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
