acceptance_criteria: files/docs positional misuse supplies a corrected --add invocation; test metadata misuse names command and timeout syntax; recovery is executable without extra help; no unintended mutation
parent: pm-f05lsg
risk: low
confidence: medium
resolution: "Public SDK recovery preserves tracker, alias, item, literal path bytes and presentation options in explicit retries; metadata-only tests receive a same-context template requiring the actual command."
expected_result: "Positional files, docs and test misuse yields actionable legal recovery without unintended mutation or invented verification."
actual_result: "Final linked suite passes 29 tests, including tracker-preserving metadata templates and literal path round trips. Fresh npm/npx and bun/bunx consumers pass; generated contracts and type checking pass. Required hosted checks remain merge conditions."
